actor","slug":"8381853606-the-reactor","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7a2c9212e9b198374ff8141a7fa735135b194a871bfbf37bcef048a947d518d6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-eb4b116810653dd686d82b8e6196628a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":2281283,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-06T02:25:41.081Z","creator":{"name":"hyffrd","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":125477260390026,"name":"[FREE SAITAMA] Shadow Battlegrounds","desc":"💥A fast-paced battleground experience with unique abilities, intense PvP, and skill-based combat. Compete to become the strongest and best fighter with characters inspired by your favorite Animes!\n\n🎮Supported devices: (PC, MOBILE, CONSOLE)\n👍Be sure to leave feedback on how we can improve!\n\n⭐ Controls\nG - Ultimate\nF - Block\nQ - Dash\nQ (while ragdolled) - ragdoll cancel/evasive\nDouble Tap W - run\nM1 - Punch","path":"/game/125477260390026-shadow-battlegrounds","slug":"125477260390026-shadow-battlegrounds","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5dec276625db276885a2f0dad8b923becc7c2d0b0abfd2925496a0f128cf4fb0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-94411bfc00eada9db7c255a58e2ffacf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":34,"visitor":23719200,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-24T06:35:13.618Z","creator":{"name":"i'm exotic","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16022043457,"name":"Draw Perfect Circle!","desc":"Can you take your shot at drawing the urban legend itself: The Perfect Circle.  \nCompete with other players to draw the most accurate circle possible!\n\nSmack the like button to support development! :)","path":"/game/16022043457-draw-perfect-circle","slug":"16022043457-draw-perfect-circle","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/46160bbd9ed031445b593fb661e56a67dc0472764fec7eb54c5ea2ec6d92d7cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-74256c26415a780ca85cf4852e69